You've met Apu. He's a shop owner. Does he ever sleep?","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/394310/f2544da45bbfb837ef1b55c9424f6ec7b0c5006d.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":85.9000015258789,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"casey","strName":"Meet Casey","strDescription":"You've met Casey. He used to be a sailor. Now he can be your employer. I think he is dangerous.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/394310/8a05c01656c63bb43883570be32fb59a3e074ca7.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":80.5999984741211,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"pizza","strName":"Pizza eater","strDescription":"It tastes good. I see that you like it. But you should probably eat healthier food.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/394310/87d43de0ade3d822396c6e4e16ee9d94b5d64893.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":75.0999984741211,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"criminal","strName":"Prevention of a crime","strDescription":"You prevented a crime for the first time. I am proud of you!","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/394310/6831fb1f286d51d9cf28f63e0f353102e7a46043.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":72.5999984741211,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"friend","strName":"A friend","strDescription":"Roy is a good guy. You could really become friends.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/394310/9b458bf2079ec2c4d8cd622d158dfe69deebee3b.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":70.9000015258789,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"tyler","strName":"Meet Tyler","strDescription":"You've met Tyler. He looks like a good guy. I think you should spend more time with him.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/394310/6495aaec98f57198b34abbd97da6c202dc405cfb.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":70.9000015258789,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ult_know","strName":"Ultimate fights","strDescription":"Now you can fight in the ultimate league. I am a little worried about possible injuries.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/394310/1fccf840521780e2611c0f07ff2b8956cd94990e.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":68.5999984741211,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"hard_train1","strName":"Training results","strDescription":"Now your shape is better than ever! You look even better than me.","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/394310/b6b2e8c79e2afd5d2c846f66dd9d02f182010c12.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":68.0999984741211,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0},{"strID":"ult_fight","strName":"Take the challenge","strDescription":"The first bloody fight - done! ","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/394310/6c9df22e2a66f43e2484856bc9bd454996230fb1.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":63.599998474121094,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0}],"vecAchievedHidden":[],"nTotal":47,"nAchieved":0}}],["achievementmap",{"version":5,"data":"[]"}],["usernews",{"version":5,"data":[]}],["gameactivity",{"version":5,"data":[]}],["workshop_trendy_items",{"version":2}],["associations",{"version":2,"data":{"rgDevelopers":[{"strName":"Lazy Bear Games","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/curator/32946824"}],"rgPublishers":[{"strName":"tinyBuild","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/tinybuild"}],"rgFranchises":[{"strName":"tinyBuild","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/franchise/tinybuild"}]}}],["descriptions",{"version":1,"data":{"strFullDescription":"你父亲在你眼前被残忍杀害。现在，你必须刻苦训练，猛吃鸡肉并用拳头攻击对面的家伙来提高你在 Punch Club 中的排名，找出杀死你父亲的人。\r\n\r\nPunch Club 是一款具备多条故事线索的拳击大亨管理游戏。你的目标非常明确，但实现方式取决于你希望正当地提高游戏排名还是选择更荒谬、阴险的方式。\r\n\r\n一路上你需要发挥自己的才能。选择迅虎之道、潜龟之道还是其他道路？你的力量、命中率和敏捷性全都取决于你选择的道路。\r\n\r\n每一个决定都事关重大，尤其是社交生活中的决定。你需要平衡友情、爱情、工作、休闲、人际关系和可能的明星身份，还需要练拳以及同鳄鱼格斗。训练并不仅仅是举重。\r\n\r\n- 拳击手管理模拟，具备角色扮演和大亨元素\r\n- 查出杀害你父亲的凶手，并不断了解自己\r\n- 由故事推动，可以选择不同的情节和探索不同的游戏结局\r\n- 深入了解统计数据，通过大量的技能树确定自己的道路\r\n- 华丽的画面，所有地方均体现出上世纪 80、90 年代的风格，流露出浓浓的复古风情","strSnippet":"刻苦训练，寻找爱情，送披萨，击打鳄鱼，与人格斗并在比赛中名列前茅。 欢迎来到拳击管理大亨 Punch Club。在这里你可以选择自己的道路，查出杀害你父亲的凶手。"}}]]